Advanced study: boiling, condensation and transfer limits (@th-study-two-phase: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer, #source "../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD", #source "../sources/Second-Level-Heat-Transfer-Vedula.lingua#r_663BY2CF56BBB35C1S595A2VRF", #source "../sources/Thermodynamics-and-Chemistry-DeVoe.lingua#r_2YHHGY26Y8X9MS9DB3MXZHD1D1", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "A-complete-thermal-service-from-physics-to-continuing-use.lingua#r_7J8HFJ2KFHGSRF5EB4JFNRZRB2") { r_7D7D3GS454M9Z5NRPJJ3CNBDCJ
**Read:** [A Heat Transfer Textbook — Lienhard and Lienhard](../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD), complete boiling and condensation chapters; [Second Level Course in Heat Transfer — R. P. Vedula](../sources/Second-Level-Heat-Transfer-Vedula.lingua#r_663BY2CF56BBB35C1S595A2VRF), the full two-phase, boiling and condensation sequence; [Thermodynamics and Chemistry — Howard DeVoe](../sources/Thermodynamics-and-Chemistry-DeVoe.lingua#r_2YHHGY26Y8X9MS9DB3MXZHD1D1), complete relevant interfacial and phase equilibrium.

Read the complete phase-change treatment and select a published boiling or condensation experiment with enough geometry, surface and operating data to reconstruct its model. Distinguish imposed power, measured heat flux, wall superheat, local state and bulk flow conditions.

Derive the applicable film or interfacial balance and compare alternative correlations within their measured ranges. Study nucleation, wetting, noncondensable gases, flow regime and hysteresis as appropriate. Treat a critical heat flux or dryout relation as an empirical/physical claim with a domain, not a universal material constant.

Deliver an independently checked energy account, uncertainty and a reasoned explanation of agreement and disagreement. Identify which additional measurements discriminate the proposed mechanisms. Work that reproduces a dangerous operating limit belongs to a properly equipped and supervised facility; a documentary analysis must retain its actual evidential status.

**Continue:** [A complete thermal service from physics to continuing use](A-complete-thermal-service-from-physics-to-continuing-use.lingua#r_7J8HFJ2KFHGSRF5EB4JFNRZRB2).

**Return:** [Thermodynamics and heat transfer](../Thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer.lingua#r_6KQBZNJM6WNV9A69R3DZY1NH7E).
